了解！ 你現在想要的是：找出「新光風險等級 > 台新風險等級」的客戶，並且同時顯示兩個系統的 ReviewDt 差異（Buffer vs EDD）。

✅ 整合版 Query（風險比對 + ReviewDt 差異）
WITH Shared_Cust AS (
    SELECT DISTINCT 
        b.CustomerNo AS TS_CUST_ID,
        b.CIF_KEY AS BSA_CIF_KEY
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b
    INNER JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v 
        ON b.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
    INNER JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP p 
        ON p.NEW_CIF_KEY = b.CIF_KEY
),
Risk_Compare AS (
    SELECT 
        c.TS_CUST_ID,
        b.HIGHRISK AS BSA_HIGHRISK,
        v.HIGHRISK AS VERIFY_HIGHRISK,
        b.NXTRVDT AS BSA_NXTRVDT,
        v.NXTRVDT AS VERIFY_NXTRVDT,
        e.ReviewDt AS EDD_ReviewDt,
        buf.ReviewDt AS Buffer_ReviewDt,
        CASE b.HIGHRISK WHEN 'H' THEN 3 WHEN 'M' THEN 2 WHEN 'L' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS BSA_Risk,
        CASE v.HIGHRISK WHEN 'H' THEN 3 WHEN 'M' THEN 2 WHEN 'L' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END AS VERIFY_Risk,
        CASE 
            WHEN buf.ReviewDt IS NULL AND e.ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 'Both NULL'
            WHEN buf.ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 'Buffer 無日期'
            WHEN e.ReviewDt IS NULL THEN 'EDD 無日期'
            WHEN buf.ReviewDt <> e.ReviewDt THEN '日期不同'
            ELSE '日期相同'
        END AS ReviewDt_Status
    FROM Shared_Cust c
    JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b 
        ON c.TS_CUST_ID = b.CustomerNo
    JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v 
        ON c.TS_CUST_ID = v.CustomerNo
    LEFT JOIN EDD_ReviewSchedule e 
        ON b.CIF_KEY = e.CIFKey
    LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer buf 
        ON b.CIF_KEY = buf.CIF_KEY
)
SELECT 
    TS_CUST_ID,
    BSA_HIGHRISK,
    VERIFY_HIGHRISK,
    BSA_Risk,
    VERIFY_Risk,
    BSA_NXTRVDT,
    VERIFY_NXTRVDT,
    Buffer_ReviewDt,
    EDD_ReviewDt,
    ReviewDt_Status
FROM Risk_Compare
WHERE BSA_Risk > VERIFY_Risk          -- 新光風險 > 台新風險
ORDER BY VERIFY_Risk DESC, BSA_Risk DESC, TS_CUST_ID;

主要調整：
	•	使用 DISTINCT 避免 mapping 一對多造成的重複。
	•	同時 LEFT JOIN Cust_NP_Migrate_buffer 和 EDD_ReviewSchedule，顯示兩個 ReviewDt。
	•	增加 ReviewDt_Status 清楚標示日期狀態。
	•	保留你原本的風險等級比對條件 BSA_Risk > VERIFY_Risk。

